.TH ZION 1 "June 2026" "Zion @VERSION@" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
zion \- Zig project, toolchain, dependency metadata, and testing utility

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zion
.RI [ COMMAND ]
.RI [ OPTIONS ]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Zion
is a Zig development tool for project scaffolding, dependency metadata, Zig/ZLS
environment management, security helpers, and a Zion-native testing surface.
Registry-backed package operations are experimental.

.SH CORE COMMANDS
.TP
.B init
Initialize a new Zig project.

.TP
.B add
Experimentally resolve and add a dependency to the current project.

.TP
.B remove , rm
Remove a dependency from the current project.

.TP
.B update
Experimentally resolve dependency updates.

.TP
.B fetch
Experimentally fetch dependencies and cache them locally.

.TP
.B build
Build the project.

.TP
.B run
Run the project executable.

.TP
.B test
Run project tests or use the Zion-native test workflow.

.TP
.B doc
Generate or open project documentation.

.TP
.B help
Show command help.

.SH ANALYSIS AND HEALTH
.TP
.B check
Check project and dependency health.

.TP
.B tree
Display the dependency tree.

.TP
.B why
Explain why a dependency is present.

.TP
.B outdated
Check for outdated dependencies.

.TP
.B status
Show project status overview.

.SH LOCKING, HASHES, AND REPAIR
.TP
.B lock
Manage the lock file.

.TP
.B hash
Generate, verify, and update package hashes.

.TP
.B pin
Pin a dependency to a specific version.

.TP
.B unpin
Unpin a dependency and resume tracking updates.

.TP
.B repair
Attempt repair of dependency or hash problems.

.SH ZIG AND TOOLING
.TP
.B zig
Manage Zig versions.

.TP
.B zls
Manage ZLS setup and diagnostics.

.TP
.B setup
Show lightweight onboarding and verification guidance.

.TP
.B workspace
Manage workspaces.

.TP
.B nvim
Neovim integration helpers.

.SH REGISTRIES, SECURITY, AND POLICY
.TP
.B registry
Inspect and configure experimental registry integrations.

.TP
.B security
Security and trust workflows.

.TP
.B keyring
GPG keyring management and signature verification helpers.

.TP
.B verify
Signature verification helpers.

.TP
.B policy
Package trust policy management.

.TP
.B publish
Experimentally publish a package.

.SH TEST WORKFLOW
.TP
.B zion test
Run standard project tests.

.TP
.B zion test bootstrap
Prepare the Zion-native test workflow layout.

.TP
.B zion test scaffold
Write the canonical suite to
.I tests/zion_test_suite.zig .

.TP
.B zion test run
Run the Zion-native workflow suite.

.TP
.B zion test bench
Run benchmark-focused workflow cases.

.TP
.B zion test ci
Run automation-profile workflow cases.

.TP
.B zion test report
Generate a structured report under
.I .zion/test/reports/ .

.SH TEST WORKFLOW OPTIONS
.TP
.B --seed
Set a reproducible workflow seed.

.TP
.B --cases
Set the workflow case count.

.TP
.B --time-budget
Set workflow time budget in milliseconds.

.TP
.B --include
Include only matching workflow test cases.

.TP
.B --exclude
Exclude matching workflow test cases.

.TP
.B --failed-only
Re-run only previously failed workflow cases.

.TP
.B --ci-profile
Select a workflow profile such as
.I default
or
.I hardened .

.SH FILES
.TP
.I build.zig.zon
Project manifest.

.TP
.I zion.lock
Lock file.

.TP
.I .zion/cache/
Downloaded package cache.

.TP
.I .zion/deps/
Extracted dependencies.

.TP
.I .zion/test/
Zion-native test workflow artifacts.

.SH REQUIREMENTS
.TP
Zig toolchain satisfying .minimum_zig_version in build.zig.zon
.TP
curl

.TP
tar
.TP
git

.SH COMMAND MATURITY INDEX
Stable local commands: init, remove, list, info, check, build, clean, lock,
hash, run, test, tree, why, policy, target, doc, config, cache, status, setup,
version, and help.

Experimental commands: add, update, fetch, pin, unpin, repair, outdated, nvim,
security, performance, debug, zig, search, registry, publish,
search-interactive, verify, tui, zls, workspace, and keyring.

Reserved or compatibility surfaces: template, fmt, analyze, and interface.

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zig (1)

